<title>UK: Berlin Hanover Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Berlin Hanover Hypo sets 200 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BERLIN HANNOVER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY   *24.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR ON 24.SEP.97 THEN 4.75 PCT COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
